Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:47:07 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] perf: index slowmode latest-post lookups

Add a concurrent partial index matching channel, user, creation time and non-system type. Keep deleted posts eligible so deletion cannot reset the cooldown. Cover query semantics and migrated index readiness in the store suite.

Builds on Karan Sharma (mr-karan) and the slowmode feature in opnlabs/mattermax#21. The original slowmode patch and its authorship remain unchanged.

Mattermax-Patch: slowmode-lookup-index.patch
---
 server/channels/db/migrations/migrations.list |  2 +
 ...0243_posts_channel_user_create_at.down.sql |  2 +
 ...000243_posts_channel_user_create_at.up.sql |  4 ++
 .../store/sqlstore/post_store_test.go         | 41 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 49 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 server/channels/db/migrations/postgres/000243_posts_channel_user_create_at.down.sql
 create mode 100644 server/channels/db/migrations/postgres/000243_posts_channel_user_create_at.up.sql

